{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港馬王「嘉應高昇」今日下午在澳洲悉尼全球獎金最豐厚草地賽事珠穆朗瑪峰錦標（The Everest，1200米一級賽）只跑第二名，衛冕失敗，未能達到跨季22連勝紀錄。</p><p>去年「嘉應高昇」成為首匹贏得此賽事的海外賽駒。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T05:38:58.927423+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:24:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T23:13:38.927886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T05:37:34.015264+00:00","content_hash":"1740982c67eab30f08b3a3c14c8331e27c8cfd4264ff81a12b9a26440708d48c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}